================================================================================
HOW TO GET A COMMERCIAL LICENSE — STEP BY STEP
================================================================================

  1. Decide you need it (you cannot or do not want to comply with the AGPL).
  2. Donate EUR 20,000 (or currency-equivalent) to EITHER EFF (https://www.eff.org/)
     OR CCC (https://www.ccc.de/). The donation must be in your organization's
     name (or clearly on its behalf).
  3. Email the donation receipt to afl@aflplus.plus, showing recipient, amount,
     date, and donor.
  4. Your one-year commercial license is effective as of your donation date.
  5. Before the year ends, renew (donate again), switch to AGPL compliance, or
     stop using AFL++.

Questions: afl@aflplus.plus
